{
  "name": "homebridge-roborock-room-clean",
  "displayName": "Roborock Room Clean",
  "version": "1.4.0",
  "description": "A fan in Apple Home for every room on your Roborock map: turn it on to clean the room, the fan speed sets the suction power. Vacuum-only and number of passes configurable, with no 10-routine limit. Your Roborock app routines can be added as switches too.",
